1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,650
112 gates and doors around
the Prophet's Mosque…

2
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:07,050
So where do you start?

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:14,650
Prophet's Mosque Visitor Guide… everything
around the Haram, on one map in your hand.

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:22,000
Type a door's number or name… see its
side, nearest gate and nearest street.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,150
One tap: "Draw route from my location"…

6
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:31,350
A clear walking route, with distance
and time, updating as you walk…

7
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,400
Take another way, and
it switches with you.

8
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:40,950
Heading to the Noble Rawdah? See whose
time it is now… and when it changes.

9
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:47,250
For women visitors: 35 places in one tap…

10
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:50,900
Doors, restrooms and prayer areas.

11
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,750
Around the Haram, everything you need:

12
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:59,350
Restrooms, hotels, restaurants,
parking and key services.

13
00:00:59,850 --> 00:01:05,250
By car? It takes you to the parking
under the Haram, then on foot.

14
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:12,700
Madinah's landmarks… illustrated stories
of nine sites, from Quba to Uhud.

15
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:18,500
In 26 languages… straight from the
browser, no app-store download,

16
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:21,850
and it asks for your location
only when you need it.

17
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:29,550
Visitor Guide… open it now: arrive
with ease, give your visit your heart.
